    "apqc_category": "9.0 Manage Financial Resources",
    "rationale": "account is the financial backbone / system of record, not a primary value-creating activity. It is a support activity in Porter/APQC terms: it records the financial consequences of primary activities (sale -> customer invoice, purchase -> vendor bill, stock -> valuation) into a double-entry ledger. APQC 9.0 Manage Financial Resources, specifically 9.2.x Process accounts receivable (account.move customer invoice action_post) and 9.5.x Process accounts payable (account.payment register payment), plus 9.x general accounting / reporting via the account.report engine."
  },
